<title>UK: ABN Amro sets warrants on L'Oreal.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro sets warrants on L'Oreal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANN Amro Bank N.V. has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants on L'Oreal shares, lead manager ABN Amro Finance S.A. said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2000 FFR		  PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     24.80 FFR		 GEARING	7.12 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.DEC.96-30.DEC.98   PAYDATE	29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1766 FFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
